# Slice 284: `@: p Box, \Inner` with the comma is the requirement Box and a dereference, though Box has the field Inner, so `p\v` names no field of Box: refused
# (BARE-DEREF-ACTUAL-MERGED).  Before, the comma was lost and the same fields read as the path `Box\Inner`.
Box:
    Inner:
        int: v 4
    end: Inner
end: Box
@: p Box, \Inner
int: code 7
if: p\v != 4
    code: 11
---
send: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
